  "title": "Kirby Problem 4.43",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let K be a knot on the boundary of $X \\setminus B^{\\circ 4}$, where X is a negative definite, smooth 4-manifold. Suppose K bounds a smoothly embedded, nullhomotopic surface $\\Sigma$ in $X \\setminus B^{\\circ 4}$. Is the following inequality $2g(\\Sigma) \\geq$ |s(K)| (8) always satisfied? Here $s(K)$ denotes Rasmussen’s s-invariant [Ras10].",
